id: phantom-genes
name: Phantom Genes
order: 3
optionOf: demon-genes
optionEffect: 5
description: >
  If you enter the Superior State through the 1st effect of Demon Genes, you may remove a Combat Condition (Impaired, Broken, Impediment, or Guard Down) you are suffering from.
text: >
  Phantom Genes [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you enter the Superior State through the 1st effect of Demon Genes, you may remove a Combat Condition (Impaired, Broken, Impediment, or Guard Down) you are suffering from.

---

# Read by Demon Genes' roll (chat.mjs demonGenesRoll).
[passive]
allow demonGenes.phantom;
